<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: killed a child -->
  <KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.label>ha ucciso un bambino</KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.label>
  <!-- EN: Killing one so young feels wrong, no matter the situation. -->
  <KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.description>Ucciderne uno così giovane sembra sbagliato, qualunque sia la situazione.</KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.description>
  
  <!-- EN: killed my birth mother -->
  <KilledMyBirthMother.stages.killed_my_birth_mother.label>ho ucciso mia madre biologica</KilledMyBirthMother.stages.killed_my_birth_mother.label>
  
  <!-- EN: my birth mother {0} died -->
  <MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.label>mia madre biologica {0} è morta</MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.label>
  <!-- EN: My birth mother died. She's gone forever. It's like a hole in my life. -->
  <MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.description>Mia madre biologica è morta. Se n'è andata per sempre. È come un buco nella mia vita.</MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.description>
  
  <!-- EN: my birth mother {0} lost -->
  <MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.label>mia madre biologica {0} è scomparsa</MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.label>
  <!-- EN: My birth mother has been lost. I hope she will get back to us someday. -->
  <MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.description>Mia madre biologica è scomparsa. Spero che un giorno tornerà da noi.</MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.description>
  
</LanguageData>